# Android Project Scaffold

This directory contains a separate Android app for the Al-Murshid Al-Yemeni project.

## Notes

- The repository root still contains the existing web app.
- The Android project is isolated in this `android/` folder to avoid overwriting the current JavaScript project.
- The scaffold includes Room, Firebase, manifest metadata, and a minimal UI to continue building the full app.

## Run

From this folder:

```bash
./gradlew assembleDebug
```

If Gradle is not installed, install it and rerun the command.
